Agent Orchestration Explained is released under the MIT licence (LICENSE).

It vendors Agent_Loop_Sim (MIT, https://github.com/BrendanJamesLynskey/Agent_Loop_Sim) in
src/lib/engine/vendor/, src/data/ and tests/fixtures/, at the commit recorded in
src/lib/engine/vendor/VENDORED.json. That includes src/data/langgraph_recordings.json, a recording
of LangGraph's checkpoint histories (LangGraph is MIT-licensed, https://github.com/langchain-ai/langgraph;
no LangGraph code is redistributed), and src/data/langgraph_graphs.py.txt, the engine's builder of
LangGraph graphs (MIT, part of Agent_Loop_Sim).

The vendored engine also contains the Qwen2.5 tokenizer port (src/lib/engine/vendor/tokenizer.ts), which
this site does not use.

The link-preview cards are set in Noto Sans and Noto Sans Mono (subsets in src/app/_og/), under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (src/app/_og/OFL.txt).
